{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"【CEDEC+KYUSHU 2026】「Ask」「AssetHub」攤位報導！高達(鋼彈)聯名鍵盤與活用AI的3D建模工具登場\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2ac4f2714cc94859b10c372f397de36f973507b5570b11de7b11d8113d7226f5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7a6003c5d4666b59d38efb74c483fd3e.jpg_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>【CEDEC+KYUSHU 2026】「Ask」「AssetHub」攤位報導！高達(鋼彈)聯名鍵盤與活用AI的3D建模工具登場</figcaption></figure><p>於2026年11月14日(六)在九州産業大學舉辦的遊戲開發者技術交流活動「<strong>CEDEC+KYUSHU 2026</strong>」<br/>本次將報導高效能PC・周邊設備專業商社「<strong>株式會社Ask</strong>」與提供遊戲開發用3D模型製作軟體的「<strong>AssetHub Inc.</strong>」攤位！</p><h2>支撐遊戲開發的硬體與軟體齊聚一堂！來看看Ask與AssetHub的展示</h2><figure><img alt=\"Ask\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ea9fbbb65637007151eb44b11d3813a118e47fff109f1a707a722b9bd169a74a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9fbd3716d0b133b036229539972ca326.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>來看看Ask攤位！</figcaption></figure><p>首先來看看在世界各國經銷PC周邊設備的「株式會社Ask」攤位！</p><figure><img alt=\"「機動戰士 Z高達」聯名款\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a182fc20c0bc15a3f401a55813dba00d188b2188ea41fc804c015069922ff36/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7534c461b7a472f8a06376c4f28a6e01.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「機動戰士 Z高達」聯名款</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「機動戰士高達 馬沙之反擊」聯名款\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bb4042a36087b42d025236b1a106cb4244e2073c3ada77659402cb3c8bf3fe12/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbb909748d8316729574142dcc4ef2a71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「機動戰士高達 馬沙之反擊」聯名款</figcaption></figure><p>一走進攤位，首先映入眼簾的是東普雷的高階鍵盤「REALFORCE」與高達系列「 機動戰士 Z高達 」「 機動戰士高達 馬沙之反擊 」的聯名產品。<br/>以各自機體為主題的設計，連每個按鍵都投射出世界觀，是極致的鍵盤。</p><p></p><figure><img alt=\"克瓦特羅・巴吉納\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f2a26df2c0be7a586fa5d574654983b649c90362b909bbd20f9ae09808dd9902/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fff5fceae53b35b230aa51f6de8b24999.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>克瓦特羅・巴吉納</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏亞・阿茲納布爾\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d1522bf39722c4c1e0c681ac2065b5ffb05f3fe0e3448572558e8b8b8697938c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4bc2789fe22b7791f2de73eafb728d02.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>夏亞・阿茲納布爾</figcaption></figure><p>也附有配合各鍵盤設計的腕托。<br/>變成百式金色的克瓦特羅・巴吉納也很帥氣呢！</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><img alt=\"H5 Flow NieR SQUARE ENIX 15th Anniversary Edition\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/51a1b2b27119414d5d24c746f30ce3fd25aef6358f161408e97c34df2c0efb00/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fad7bbaa39af35cd07c9fe81db057aa3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>H5 Flow NieR聯名款</figcaption></figure><p>旁邊展示的是為紀念NieR系列15週年而製作的中塔型PC機殼「H5 Flow NieR SQUARE ENIX 15th Anniversary Edition」<br/>凱寧的插畫十分美麗，令人看得入迷。</p><figure><img alt=\"主機板\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/267d30a36195231010c1d7e851b83a0f96b06dc4b4ae556d128cb9722449808b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6820db5cb887b24eaebb43be0b34f1c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>主機板</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"散熱器\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c30b0a7eaa4cab34c38931d9c175d5716b89bec5ab132a454427b1d274d1f2b4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1733936520b5530eae0ad7a9893a50a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>散熱器</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"顯示卡\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/636a5add023bbd9498f1e697f2f81d9f55ad485345de17603f54c827c1d63b6e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd65bf3bbee64dce8590f728565353ab0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>顯示卡</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電源供應器\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b4cae0c2cd438c0e3e6690bd0367d2064f465bd97ff297d6c6b07009dc7aee76/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F313630755738ea051964252819dc63e2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>電源供應器</figcaption></figure><p>除此之外，也展示了主機板與顯示卡等桌上型PC不可或缺的零件。</p><h3>來看看以3D建模工具引領世界的「AssetHub Inc.」！</h3><figure><img alt=\"AssetHub Inc.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4628b289ed4aeb3587b0a802018dd45d5da2f1cb267d911747572fdb3482148b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2c91fa0c7401e2806669dc40bdf2e731.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「AssetHub Inc.」攤位</figcaption></figure><p>接著要看的是販售活用AI的3D建模工具的「AssetHub Inc.」攤位！</p><figure><img alt=\"3D模型\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3c76db1e2113f837d80a703267535ee5f304c311697b0a3a2f093947734660a8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7bb98ea8b7db3bf48369670664013261.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>美少女3D模型</figcaption></figure><p>讓我們見識了實際的建模！<br/>可以看出連細節都精心製作。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"形象影片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4c565be6598dc967547410d58bd5ec5319ff2dc0dd5403b5b5be2cfce4a62278/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff9e3e6d68d5ed5285c0b1ddcfa2115b9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>攤位內播放著3D建模的形象影片。<br/>據說從美少女角色到充滿威嚴的老戰士，都能製作 配合遊戲形象的各種角色 。</p><p>這是能一次享受遊戲開發所需的硬體到軟體，充滿CEDEC風格的攤位展示。<br/>也請關注「株式會社Ask」與「AssetHub Inc.」今後的發展！</p><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/razer-evangelion-01-collaboration-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Razer推出 5 款以初號機為主題的產品！「Razer | EVANGELION(EVA-01)系列」現已開放預訂</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/razer-reclusa-mini-65/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Razer發表支援無線與熱插拔的磁軸電競鍵盤「Razer Reclusa Mini 65%」！預定12月發售</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/tgs2026-keychron-booth-report/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸【TGS2026】「Keychron」展位報導！親身體驗分體式鍵盤「Valkey Orb」與小型軌跡球裝置「Nape Pro」</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/tgs2026-fumoshop-booth-report/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸【TGS2026】「Fumo的店」攤位報導！大量展出與VTuber、遊戲、動畫聯名的鍵盤</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/tgs2026-andgamer-booth-report/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸【TGS2026】「AndGAMER」攤位報導！與「鬥陣特攻」的聯名企劃，以及「AIM1」「Void Gaming」等產品登場</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:59.531823+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1172,"images":14,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:37:35.565656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:37.234601+00:00","content_hash":"28b9b7850aa5c7194f3614ec977df8b61c95160cb85c16a80e67101e8987f9f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}